docker compose version

mkdir jenkins-static-site
cd jenkins-static-site

notepad docker-compose.yml

docker compose up -d

docker ps

docker exec jenkins cat /var/jenkins_home/secrets/initialAdminPassword

docker ps


The Docker Compose configuration and Pipeline script are pasted into their respective files or Jenkins interface, not executed as CMD commands.
4. Expected Output
- Jenkins container runs successfully using Docker.
- Jenkins dashboard opens at http://localhost:8080.
- Pipeline job karunya-site-pipeline is created.
- Build completes with Finished: SUCCESS.
- Karunya University static website is published.
- HTML and CSS files are archived successfully.
5. Result
Jenkins was successfully installed and configured using Docker. A Pipeline was created to generate and publish a static website, and the generated HTML and CSS files were archived successfully.
